  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialaugeTriggers
  _message: 'Welcome to Infinitower! You are the great Wizard Decimus who is returning

    home
    to his apartment on the 999 floor, only to find that the nefarious Witch Mathilda
    has cursed the entire building and stripped you of your magical staff and cursed
    you with Arithmophobia, the fear of numbers!


    You''ll have to use your physical
    prowess to ascend the tower. Each floor has transformed into a cursed obstacle
    course for you to conquer. Reach the elevator at the end of each level to traverse
    to the next floor.'
